 can do to","w":0.35947711944580074},{"y":0.25416666644290065,"w":0.4008714294433593,"text":"make the world a better place? One thing you can do is","x":0.50108934591739063,"h":0.014728682041168173},{"w":0.38562091827392575,"h":0.013081394831339521,"x":0.50108931914190424,"text":"volunteer and help others who may be unable to help","y":0.27034883754072558},{"y":0.28488372131010542,"w":0.30501089096069334,"h":0.013081394831339521,"text":". This is exactly what Nigel Courtney did.","x":0.60348583483918872},{"x":0.49891068471234673,"y":0.29941860481050475,"w":0.4161219787597657,"h":0.014534883499145557,"text":"Nigel,16, first volunteered last year by helping an elderly"},{"x":0.50108933290206092,"y":0.31375000006478015,"w":0.41830062866210938,"h":0.013333333333333197,"text":"neighbour, Arthur, in his garden. The garden is large and"},{"h":0.014689922332763672,"w":0.41394332885742191,"text":"because Arthur is old, he is unable to care for the garden","x":0.49891069368675744,"y":0.3283333333339602},{"w":0.16122003555297859,"h":0.013333332935969056,"text":".'I can't manage by 3","x":0.59912854229976342,"y":0.34291666680308786},{"x":0.83660130782878706,"h":0.014641472498575836,"y":0.34291666680429145,"w":0.056644878387451247,"text":"_; said"},{"y":0.35901162782900853,"text":"Arthur, 'but with Nigel's help the garden now looks great","w":0.41830062866210938,"h":0.011821705500284718,"x":0.5032679905055466},{"w":0.08932461738586428,"text":"once again.'","h":0.011627906958262102,"x":0.50108932596937716,"y":0.37354651152086893},{"h":0.013333333730697561,"y":0.39083333294144862,"x":0.50108933258252575,"w":0.41830062866210938,"text":"Soon, Nigel found ways to help others too: 'I noticed that"},{"y":0.40541666662140186,"w":0.40305011749267583,"text":"many homeless people have dogs for company because","h":0.013333333730697672,"x":0.50108932537675566},{"y":0.41860465092597199,"w":0.19607843399047847,"text":"they get lonely living by 4-","h":0.015988372166951481,"x":0.49891067614201562},{"text":"_. The owners love","x":0.76906318452638767,"y":0.42151162784354335,"h":0.011821705500284718,"w":0.14379084587097168},{"h":0.014583333333333282,"text":"their dogs but they have problems getting food for them.'","w":0.42265792846679689,"x":0.49891068366057395,"y":0.43458333331359755},{"x":0.50108933365465225,"y":0.44912790728999874,"w":0.4074073791503906,"h":0.013081394831339521,"text":"Nigel arranged for donations of dog food to be collected"},{"text":"outside a supermarket and then distributed among the","y":0.4649999998811204,"w":0.39869281768798825,"h":0.011744186083475827,"x":0.50108932598716038},{"text":"homeless. Does Nigel really expect nothing in return for","h":0.013081394831339521,"x":0.50108933129225053,"y":0.47819767445933026,"w":0.41176467895507807},{"text":"his efforts? 'Helping other people is a reward in itself,' he","x":0.49891069133343324,"y":0.49273255820197759,"w":0.41830062866210938,"h":0.014534883499145557},{"x":0.50108934142612516,"y":0.50872093070933033,"w":0.39651412963867183,"text":"said. I'm happy to help other people and truly believe","h":0.013081394831339521},{"text":"that we should all help5","w":0.18082788467407229,"h":0.013333332935969056,"x":0.50108932828750996,"y":0.52166666704006937},{"x":0.50108932649274607,"text":"when I need help, somebody will be there for me?","w":0.36819171905517578,"y":0.5362500001128736,"h":0.014622093041737894},{"y":0.57994186033376061,"h":0.014641473293304452,"x":0.48583878190886082,"w":0.44008712768554686,"text":"4 *** Complete the second sentence so that it has"},{"w":0.4008714294433593,"x":0.51198258063053548,"y":0.59583333349993506,"text":"a similar meaning to the first. Use no more than six","h":0.011724805831909157},{"h":0.011676356395085685,"text":"words, including the word in capitals.","w":0.29629629135131841,"x":0.51198257821686055,"y":0.61041666680303763},{"x":0.5381263687704092,"w":0.29847494125366203,"y":0.62790697675342699,"h":0.011676356395085685,"text":"Stacy and Lou painted